    "ContentDesc_Das nördliche Kreszentia": "In the heart of Shades' Triangle lies a verdant isle cloaked in a ward that keeps all but the most persistent from making landfall─trapping forever those intrepid few who somehow breach its magicks. It is on these shores, studded with ruins from the Fifth Astral Era, that you meet the Archive, a scholar-turned-tonberry whose knowledge has been sealed away by powers unknown. As you labor to uncover the isle's secrets and break the seal on the Archive's wisdom, Ketenramm and his crew manage to carve a path into the island's northern reaches. Ready to learn the truth of the Occult Crescent, you steel yourself for the trials to come...",
    "ContentName_North Horn": "North Horn",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_A Rotten Affair_Desc": "Undeterred by the fetid pall that chokes the air, this statuesque guardian endures, deadly and vengeful. Though its graceful winged form is a sight to behold, its dominion must be brought to an end.",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_A Rotten Affair_Name": "A Rotten Affair",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Eye to Eye_Desc": "With a single cursed gemstone in place of an eye, this dread beast prowls the wastes of the North Horn. Dispense with the creature before you succumb to its baleful gaze.",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Eye to Eye_Name": "Eye to Eye",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Inconstant Gardener_Desc": "This leaf-clad familiar once labored to maintain the island's delicate ecological balance. Alas, when aetherial anomalies began to plague the North Horn, Iambe was corrupted─much like the land they once nurtured. Ensure they can do no further harm.",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Inconstant Gardener_Name": "Inconstant Gardener",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Scale Model_Desc": "Contrary to its lithe, organic form, this entity is, in fact, a complex, finely wrought golem built in the likeness of an ancient serpentine creature. On an island of replicas, this is one recreation best consigned to oblivion.",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Scale Model_Name": "Scale Model",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Thunderregnum_Desc": "This regal beast rules over the North Horn, subjugating its kingdom with shocking displays of violence. It is high time the tyrant was toppled from their throne.",
    "FATEs_Kill Boss_Thunderregnum_Name": "Thunderregnum",
